<title>ITALY: Stet /Telecom plan to be worked out in Jan.</title>
<headline>Stet /Telecom plan to be worked out in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of a government plan to fuse Italy's state-owened phone operator Telecom Italia with its parent company Stet will be worked out this month, Stet's managing director said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Within January we could define the procedures of the merger&quot; Ernesto Pascale told reporters.</p>
<p>The Treasury took direct control of Stet from state holding IRI last month in preparation for the merger and privatisation later this year of the merged entity.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
